# TERRA — environment configuration
#
# Phase 1 requires NO secrets. The globe uses Cesium's bundled offline
# Natural Earth II imagery, and place search uses the public, key-less
# Open-Meteo geocoding API. Everything below is optional and only unlocks
# higher-detail imagery or future (Phase 2+) providers.
#
# NEVER commit a real .env file. Frontend-exposed values (VITE_*) are public
# by design — never place private/secret provider keys behind a VITE_ prefix.

# Optional: Cesium Ion access token. If provided, enables Cesium Ion world
# imagery/terrain assets as an additional base-layer option. Leave blank to
# use the offline Natural Earth II imagery that ships with Cesium.
# Get a free token at https://ion.cesium.com/ (subject to Cesium's terms).
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=

# Optional: override the geocoding endpoint (default: Open-Meteo, no key).
# VITE_GEOCODE_BASE_URL=https://geocoding-api.open-meteo.com/v1
